OL,4,BSpurs 'a match for anyone' as European 
OL,5,Bhopes boosted                          
OL,6,GDreams of reaching the Women's         
OL,7,GChampions League may have seemed       
OL,8,Gfanciful for Tottenham Hotspur when    
OL,9,Gthe season began.                      
OL,11,FThe Women's Super League has an        
OL,12,Festablished big four, and big-spending 
OL,13,FLondon City Lionesses were the side    
OL,14,Fmaking the most obvious play to        
OL,15,Fdisrupt that dominance.                
OL,17,FBut a hugely impressive and deserved   
OL,18,Fwin at Manchester City on Sunday       
OL,19,Fafternoon proves Spurs are a team on   
OL,20,Fthe up, and the table shows they       
OL,21,Fremain firmly in top-three contention. 
